    "retention":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["manifestRef","proposalRef","settlementRef","checkpointRef","sequence","selectionStatus"],"properties":{"manifestRef":{"$ref":"#/$defs/reference"},"proposalRef":{"$ref":"#/$defs/reference"},"settlementRef":{"oneOf":[{"type":"null"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/reference"}]},"checkpointRef":{"$ref":"#/$defs/reference"},"sequence":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10000},"selectionStatus":{"enum":["PENDING","SETTLED"]}}},
    "classification":{"enum":["EXACT_HISTORY_MATCH","FORWARD_HISTORY_EXTENSION","OBSERVED_STRICT_HISTORY_ROLLBACK_RELATIVE_TO_PRESENTED_CHECKPOINT","OBSERVED_HISTORY_REPLACEMENT_OR_FORK_RELATIVE_TO_PRESENTED_CHECKPOINT","OBSERVED_LEDGER_IDENTITY_DRIFT","OBSERVED_LEDGER_ABSENT","OBSERVED_LEDGER_OR_CONFIGURATION_INVALID"]},
