    "decision":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["reviewRequired","holdRequired","bestAction","autonomousActionCount"],"properties":{"reviewRequired":{"const":true},"holdRequired":{"type":"boolean"},"bestAction":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":180},"autonomousActionCount":{"const":0}}},
